    narr:generatedFrom "325fa4012c689ede68409e3d38e9831ceb6c5b30" ;
    narr:narration """This hub covers the establishment and rationale of a signed-manifest gate for Meridian deployments, dated 20260718. [The deployment requirement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1) states the rule in present-tense authority: every Meridian deploy now requires a signed release manifest before it ships. [The incident rationale](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2) grounds that rule in a concrete past event — two unsigned artifacts reaching staging last quarter — framing the gate as a direct response rather than precautionary policy. Three session-level conclusions then crystallize what the exchange settled: [the gate rule itself](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3) as a decision bullet, [the scope](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4) explicitly covering both staging and production, and [ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5) assigned to Quinton Fairweather. The children are tightly convergent — rationale, rule, scope, owner — all on the same date, with no dissent recorded. Queries about Meridian deployment controls, manifest signing requirements, staging/production gate scope, or Fairweather's ownership of this control will find support here; queries about rollback procedures, signing key management, or exceptions handling will not.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The rationale is reactive (two past incidents) rather than proactive policy design — a reader could ask whether the gate scope would have been drawn differently absent that specific trigger." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Ownership is assigned to a single named individual rather than a team or role, which sits in tension with the session-collective framing of the other conclusions." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:writer "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6" .
